][]|CFFe6cc80Artifact Ability|R



Summon a stampede of forest denizens that charge forward. Each member of the stampede shields allies for |CFFffffff$<shieldValue>|R and grants $1257531s1% attack and casting speed for $1257531d up to $1257531u times. The stampede inflicts |CFFffffff$<damageValue>|R Physical damage to enemies struck, immobilizing them for $1252891d.

